      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: This is not fixed in 856. The same thing is still happening, here is a video I just took that compares to live: https://streamable.com/jzyj4\n\nIt's not just this avatar but others as well, such as one where I have a necklace that does not move on live but goes into my chest when I look down and stretches up when I look up in beta. I've also heard that people with giant tits on their avatar have those moving in hilarious ways when they look up or down and around.\n\nAlso this from new beta test seems to show the same or similar thing happening with strange weight painting, the zipper here on this unity-chan model has seemed to become unweighted somehow to the chest https://streamable.com/6rvlp",
      "viewerReactions": null
